# Whitelist repo: ignore everything in this folder by default,
# then re-admit only the design to-do files. This keeps the
# prototypes, spreadsheets, and Word docs out of the repo while
# letting the .git directory live in the working folder.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Design-TODO.md
!Design-TODO-detail.md
!Design-TODO-Shared.md
!design-todo.html
!make-shared-todo.py
